{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國野生動物保護協會公布，根據與比利時天堂公園今年9月簽訂的《關於開展大熊貓保護研究合作的補充協議》，來自中國大熊貓保護研究中心的大熊貓「冉冉」將赴比利時，延續兩國的大熊貓保護合作項目。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:24.326592+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T03:13:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T12:58:06.670420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.536546+00:00","content_hash":"0a3a5c2d65a4fb81e22d600e6402c26d1913fe2c1ed7927e734787a1ca5788dd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}